.TH batten-policy-tools 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-policy\-tools \- Print the tool names the mediated\-call rows decide, one per line
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten policy tools\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the tool names the mediated\-call rows decide, one per line
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
